<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 1/JULY 2.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 1/JULY 2.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, July 2, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   02.07.97	  01.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6644	    6.6504</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2913	    2.3017</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5060	    4.5120</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4777	    3.5008</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5171	    0.5188</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7688	    0.7717</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2865	    0.2875</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9924	    7.0022</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6918	    0.6930</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2159	    1.2223</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
